== blank after a continuation:
2:10: warning: A blank follows the backslash, and the line does not continue. (SC1101)
     2 |  echo one \ 
       |           ^~
note: Delete the blanks between the backslash and the line ending.
== tab after a continuation:
2:10: warning: A blank follows the backslash, and the line does not continue. (SC1101)
     2 |  echo one \    
       |           ^~~~~
note: Delete the blanks between the backslash and the line ending.
== a clean continuation stays quiet:
rc=0
